        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 26 at 2:58AM AKDT until September 27 at 5:00AM AKDT by NWS Juneau AK</headline>
        <description>Southeast Alaska Coastal Waters from Dixon Entrance to
Cape Suckling out 100 NM

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Seas forecasts represent the average of the highest
one-third of the combined windwave and swell height.

.TODAY...SE wind 20 kt. Seas 9 ft. Rain early in the morning.
.TONIGHT...S wind 20 kt. Seas 9 ft. Rain.
.SUN...S wind 25 kt. Seas 11 ft. Rain.
.SUN NIGHT...SW wind 25 kt. Seas 11 ft. Rain.
.MON...S wind 15 kt. Seas 9 ft.
.TUE...S wind 15 kt. Seas 8 ft.
.WED...SE wind 10 kt. Seas 8 ft.
</description>
